@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include _style.iuml
[*] --> StudyOnly
state "Study-only mode" as StudyOnly : lyrics + translations + explanations\nno transport, manual scroll (DCR-7)
state "Linked (synced)" as LinkedSynced : highlight + auto-scroll\ntap line = seek, transport
state "Linked (plain)" as LinkedPlain : transport + progress\nmanual scroll, no highlight
StudyOnly --> LinkedSynced : source connected AND\nplaying this song AND synced lyrics
StudyOnly --> LinkedPlain : source connected AND\nplaying this song AND plain lyrics
LinkedSynced --> StudyOnly : source lost / revoked (ONRQ-6)\nor track changed (ONRQ-15)
LinkedPlain --> StudyOnly : source lost / track changed
LinkedSynced --> LinkedSynced : snapshot received:\nSyncEngine re-anchors
@enduml
